  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18334320647befd461bb4113",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难得可以跑GＩ，\r\n就要好好地拟定策略啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "742cc58e63d1230bfa75abca5a4db1c173f3c5b3acc1580fcebaa4af533f1e9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef3e1eb16feaa5c21c9d253d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是盛装打扮版小青哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f7d84673d491451eced1a133bc2f7df83f19bb26e37b895e22ba20e12ef20d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:720f531fb9f8912b5f9d7df1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摄影time。",
      "source_fingerprint": "294abf0b89900640aa254ab3f35b9b5f9f3b45df3ddbdbcf068711d0cbe06d80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbdb172084bc3ba4eeb72dc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我去咯——",
      "source_fingerprint": "49c87dc39f67e8774041ff4f0c5da95bb2529cec51d206eb8280c05d02c5aac1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98cbcee837173d84a93ad0f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "会有什么样的结果就敬请期待咯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbc3382a0bae3f5a12319e8bf1e3df71f7f099a271f5ee8551797ee77f289d78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24ac10d45595ac62fe1147bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论散步、钓鱼还是午睡都可以穿这套解决～",
      "source_fingerprint": "98d57040db196d487b447e5c7e4b3404ed31593db2bf24f96bae70ce45ca9f32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfdfcea126e5798b6fc44a2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小青的穿搭铁则是宽松舒适。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc4db03313741aa352e508f76ad9e054d73c53d08a161a5f97445fa4d3059134",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbda1cbe2da3e28c0bea0e64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用烦恼每天要穿什么！\r\n制服最棒了——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b53d32ee66057324b7fe9989d1d770c3f9f29335d2616489ff72f8eb67cfc61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b714dcef4111ccc074a1c3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑完就要开演唱会……\r\n其实很辛苦的耶～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c71800ef249b7d5069a53d492cd303035a802430088a3c6c33a850f4a2f4bcba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8e086e5325c6f2147aeec5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我最棒的衣服哦——",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e7408fb5dfb9c0bd1fd04f281dddfb48eaf7ac1a9c81b065323a9f73a2e3790",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3b2341ad7d3aedbe8d52cdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀？我没有穿反吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "878863a76ffdb3d73e9305f9e52e476baeb6e8b6bb63b7c66f4a5dcf50d14d1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:227edcd7631885babe936e3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "青酱我可爱吗？呀☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec54abfc2245c86ecb518cd8e267e1d6deeca343a563638afd031433d3f041f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a526c0e2244050b4e6f34d1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难得可以跑GＩ，\r\n就要好好地拟定策略啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "742cc58e63d1230bfa75abca5a4db1c173f3c5b3acc1580fcebaa4af533f1e9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97b3c5c3c37769357be49f4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是盛装打扮版小青哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f7d84673d491451eced1a133bc2f7df83f19bb26e37b895e22ba20e12ef20d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24b3ee66e04b5401869e0130",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摄影time。",
      "source_fingerprint": "294abf0b89900640aa254ab3f35b9b5f9f3b45df3ddbdbcf068711d0cbe06d80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70b7a8cf8110a282135608fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我去咯——",
      "source_fingerprint": "49c87dc39f67e8774041ff4f0c5da95bb2529cec51d206eb8280c05d02c5aac1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88b5193d089a03c1b5b3dc9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "会有什么样的结果就敬请期待咯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbc3382a0bae3f5a12319e8bf1e3df71f7f099a271f5ee8551797ee77f289d78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f41a212e86cc261008d07e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cf1757ed31216713238abba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶，向我发起挑战是认真的吗～？\r\n会输掉哦～？指我自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "334c7a05d841d6e8cc7ab79a5817f94adc538a4955f1da1bcf66716e48f521d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c48ecf3dfc34033dc7213cb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……真的好强啊。\r\n但是我对一直输这种事，\r\n可不怎么喜欢哦",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ad556450196631c357c207c5efd23f6e09f1cbaace707c83cd3307ae61ef7d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d30c5b6327ff3bbc6b7daf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，一早就发现奇迹了耶！\r\n你看……没想到！\r\n青酱竟然来上学了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c859bd790bd27d9c1ede29fd2696fdd280aece1705313e9290c5133c3b627f63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:863b4f81aa734d3411d53004",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早啊——\r\n今天也要悠哉随性地度过一天哦——",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f01f926dc5a9ac963887fb3ce15ea2a072db2b15210730a1a8b2df8cfdae79d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c34026b77f548f598422255e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～上午辛苦了。\r\n所以下午我要休息——\r\n……咦？不行？怎么这样～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2f89f839a5dd5d7a6c45f6435f2dd5c74bf352e9d0f556b847b469590a9e509",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4605e7f972997a852fec14a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀哎呀？\r\n该不会是来约青酱一起午睡的吧？\r\n那我会很开心耶～呀哈哈～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f9f67d4799c57f7a9c9ade9127b953a1047f9bfe5fe20dac82f1b637c3e09c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3eb519db042cb2dac71a7f0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦，看见星星了……\r\n这就代表……要开始准备夜钓了！\r\n……咦？不对吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b70da9e2e12e78d6a7db545765e7437a58da3ad01fd30f9fb4b85eb630414fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ea6658d6559fe99e8a91881",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一边看电视一边喝茶。\r\n这对我来说是无比珍贵的时间……\r\n所以我想要先回家了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2becc53ed3c649b75016a7e5597f8b27d3d4ecf36bf0d846f1f6c08a3d8a0fd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87c80e9a268c537eb4060239",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只专心寻找蒲公英棉毛的日子。\r\n人生也是需要这种日子的……\r\n譬如说像是明天之类的～偷瞄。",
      "source_fingerprint": "111455ef28e0a16aafc529d8a954a11745abd32bf23bc5888d2b0f7a3af73d90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9739845b2450fa03758ca3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气一直很热呢～\r\n……图书室不知道有没有空位——\r\n唉～我需要凉爽的地方啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9477d366b0837e3495a9b53fc37f9a80a0a402d76ed9bb40a62d45599a10ecb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f62670fd973a14845e91f40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天到处都能找到蓬松的落叶堆！\r\n也就代表，\r\n在哪都可以睡觉的意思，耶嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14576650743493d22b67b1686d8e76f99361bd9c0310b6898ecdb8ff31c601f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3a5f8d7b959b4cd9afd077b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀——好冷好冷……\r\n我打算要冬眠了，所以春天的时候，\r\n你再来叫醒我……不行吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "61057fd12e69c0a1343437a699640f98bf1dabe328ade8e5328fd224ca1b8ca3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:454971ff02db60dba4b77714",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一大清早就整理得这么完美，\r\n小青很了不起吧？\r\n现在正是表扬我的好机会哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "335f4044771fa0c7174c426d687ce14124e8e168791c39d43c8fa52915f77cb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f04856396e064fdf723dec3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，\r\n我们来喝点红茶什么的吧。\r\n……这可不是在邀请你偷懒哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "75fbde64b9fb9afc633f140c1cfe3e59c5f5a630dd13623fea08ae87b2e9275e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bafe87917e95f8be1c74215",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，脖子勒得好难受～\r\n……但我可不会解开哦，真遗憾☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "16384df9a53b48d635a79c7c83bdd22296c6e06e1a0c6eef2725c93e0d6a3725",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad0951cd57857d76aaff02e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也去换个衣服，\n把这里当成舞厅吧。\r\n大家一定会被吓一跳的～嘻嘻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b88234af0e7127a538e0759ac7dd04d583aa76527fc877ed1da8e0cf5510818f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31f6a62f6cb3534ddb77a151",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将训练员任命为\r\n小青王子的仆人。\r\n“摸鱼”的准备就拜托你了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dab4cf0631a099defb89ab5a7dfe2a8a60a8eefc0d3d99b1835b2e6369f64a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a63576444a86c30368600f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我看上去很可靠吗？\r\n……偶尔也依靠一下我嘛。\r\n开玩笑的啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d51da8b60a385332ef6391b2976565f5e6a085616785d430a934b12a6234645e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ceac1232f9aa183a24c9d70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到新学期的回忆的话……\r\n小时候觉得开学典礼什么的很麻烦。\r\n就经常躲到空无一人的教室里去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19eb8128a51cc6f0fe72b83415185d5e3716f6acefba3422158ca732d8877abc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1472136b176110991c5861d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……其实里面穿着束身衣。\r\n类似浴衣里的毛巾，用于\r\n矫正身形的东西……好热啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad46977722346fbc5733aef1b6c9334567066376d960ee00911cd7e8a3c7498d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cad95a184e04453ed9a1777",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光明同学推荐我穿白色的紧身裤啊～\r\n……那可是相当认真的眼神呐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "485a3bbe8f563eec33b49cbef6228375331fcf7843e5a2a551f47b8dbcb73b34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5425496484f2c042893c7620",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是在我小声嘀咕着没有合适的外套之后，\r\n圣王给我准备的……\r\n但我是明白的……这绝对很贵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "109c9a98547770c2da81454c18041ba5ef574feacc323d8f68584dfafef49996",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2114e5a1830a835b808a018c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50a02cafaefff2c87cad55cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09737afb272c5024541ab2e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员每天都要陪着我们，\r\n真是辛苦耶～\r\n偶尔也休息一下吧～？嘻嘻嘻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "297c258e51963116cee0054b31db521ceb2be3091f1cc2a1de7071e5906d1c70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a51ed71c351d28374b99046",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "未读信息超过十个之后，\r\n就会懒得再看手机了。\r\n……哇，又变多了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "72deef82f30492baa796a9403e1d6a976cfdf0fbfcc61230ee857e0f2176600e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:499c6bb7a6f36f98d5d34b4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不觉得进闸门很浪费时间吗？\r\n里面莫名地又闷又挤……唉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a668f31d8384af150e9c8620271d1dc19abec0f1485a90e640aa5d43dfca131",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f63d31d6b7153a4e97f8426",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……啊，对了。\r\n见到圣王可以帮我传话吗——？\r\n叫她“不要浪费时间来找我”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "521d283f2a9a352f204e6576653ec198ce6ad1cacd6022d3345d5acb784eb77c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cec95e92943bcedda57d0032",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不可以惹小草生气。\r\n……我再说一次哦？\r\n千万不可以惹小草生气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6806d02c2796326123a1912fa10a1379ab9e0e52e465bcb355ac1157f2eda9ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d8a06d056215db32fc69905",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没想到我穿上这衣服的日子\r\n居然来了……真令我惊讶。\r\n居然是会露出肚脐的衣服……",
      "source_fingerprint": "94198b7f712c874eae2b2651ab8e61ee481c0f0939ccf5cba02a6f71b27c3da9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a26fbb33911d87196e6b1eb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实我把领口稍微弄松了。\r\n反正又看不出来，没差对吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "c84277a371bad6d67ba048f2e4652cdd5b6f7af2545ceed6f8248ce9d29f8c7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:662218f2305426f49429c769",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然会特地给我决胜服——\r\n……该不会……是对我有所期待吧？\r\n啊哈哈，青酱我伤脑筋了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d9ded58234a02b3fa08b56da8cad0d2da3b0cfb4832b780bcaf87b0b8d5b7de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ca07fa0b8b6f690cb8eced4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是衣服还是比赛都要轻松～\r\n都照我的步调吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "80c774721d4659bcb1b8595a05722a027f0bff724e3183d9db23c46e58acad75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9d799be5cdcaa64743b31fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论我多早起来，\r\n永远都会看到小鹰在跑步——\r\n反正我是学不来的啦——呼啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83082d40df0dafeeedd09741ab8996af88f7ecb843b896835fd2b9b1fe9a1f5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3eb97531b96fee7df3bba9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小特吃饭时总是吃得很香呢～\r\n……是说她的胃，\r\n到底是通到什么地方啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c740626efa6fa6371f00b9e88153a9905fab5cd7c6a69281c3efc2754249eb86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2055e7d50af784b9b72ca95d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早点睡……之类的，\r\n像小花一样的叮咛我可不听哦，\r\n我睡觉的时间由我决定！现在！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab8c62feffacee9ca53d8576958c8f50ed1e878f9ee2a68143d8eb1e205ba2dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d50ccbee1794fe5fb332ad94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气变得越来越温暖了～\r\n好想要一直躺在草地上哦——\r\n……最好是一辈子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "596626344492aef1477c28b4e3fddf2258619dfe9e75aa73dc88768c2bd22f9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1165f15c27e2337f48007f7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天要小心中暑哦！\r\n我得一直赖在家里不出门才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cde10f286b07b17fdfcc01a90a9b0b1d846312198b8b031fde3555ba2ee4facc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a75bcc938bfa9a77333997b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个季节就是要吃秋刀鱼呢——\r\n虽然不容易钓到……\r\n但这样才有钓的价值嘛——",
      "source_fingerprint": "6df7890dd472d7cd834b86585953fb15eeab10b316843c282616709126617352",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c95026682add954c913aa859",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔——真的好冷哦——\r\n这种时候还是\r\n跟小猫咪窝在一起取暖好了——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f0352ba91fc97a32df1d4a723eea402d689d3fd8481b759748ad7e56e69be75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce2afe599545761ac9600ecf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……我的领结系得很漂亮吗？\r\n这个嘛……虽然不是我自己弄的。\r\n但我会帮你转达给她的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5851be5063acd976d6551a84878ac72ffdecf08297a5432f379a89efb9824c09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a192a79f8c73c0b556499218",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小特他们，说着“好帅啊”什么的捉弄我。\r\n小青好可怜哦～呜呜呜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51a742854766919ce5d8b8b5e5885b865a6cbfd243d0b2787a6ae61e03ef173e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d69d5f590d2e9325ec2cdb75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……富士同学，不在这里吧？\r\n最近，跳舞的邀请太频繁了☆\r\n如果看见她的话请帮我瞒过去………",
      "source_fingerprint": "40fdb664a48d0e6c2f9f860da557121d3638ec295045a9b0a33ccb4f3bcfc798",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a15a907900710885ef244c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神宫同学的电脑\r\n是一个特别厉害的情报宝库哦。\r\n……要不要试试去做个交易呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7927b3cf71badca04da743f9f270e35ecaec1bcb0361f6cef861b3482bcd1c41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07b0604925837eb39807e2be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "配合着节奏one two☆\r\n……之类的，不太适合我呢。\r\n还是随性地上吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0256bd11e4ccc8c2944a2d72b887ad0cdd62bdc57bfdc7cef45c0410c617e88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0401be30e1fcf1efbee6c641",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～……啊，在偷看呀～\r\n这种时候把视线移开才符合礼仪……\r\n说到底就不该在人前打哈欠？诶嘿☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a594c06b47f2dead0909d0061fc311639e63d5f20affc4b1b85a5ff3549d41a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d70375100846b92ca0e80b50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戴着手套吃饭的秘诀……\r\n那就是，让别人喂我吃！\r\n所以，啊——♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "094b96396a357c6d3b9582cfcef31ea73ccf0a3bcbb443f2ea1277c37ccf6b8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0617637ee2f54f3af22e780d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，该去睡觉了吧？\r\n我会在梦中与你一起舞蹈的啦",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d939e371f66931548171c56b65363b1759cc6879119af1552b3ce309a2234df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13a2348545b4b983d474db24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞会啊——虽然很有\r\n讲究排场的特雷森学园的风格。\r\n但接下来……算了，只是在边上看一下的话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83efddafec81fd152254299ba7a44638a11a5c53afc79726b6d2805b6c04961e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60ce440e69b91b4594c26292",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……什么啊，你那好像在说\r\n“光看着就觉得很热”的脸。\r\n我跟你讲～……太对了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b064e7d8e9c7c8831436c5b35ee40ac75b11f3342042b038a8f6688d32e877c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9a9bc967da6022235c6cd6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我对古典音乐没什么兴趣，\r\n但要是在落叶之中听的话还挺不错的呢～\r\n……因为可以睡得很香☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1700caa0271442f0beb49dc3296ff587255979ea15aa5eec8d0fd735c822e6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efea46edae9a50c1c2ab8875",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜哇～膝盖好冷！\r\n于是乎，江洋大盗登场！\r\n外套借我一下啦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7f8c4f418210607bb1f9e0e054c1ec9cdbdf32c3abe2cbf804bdb838dd18987",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87605cca02870c1f56f166f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有人说现在的我，“像个大人一样令人十分紧张”什么的。\r\n真伤脑筋呢～……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ff436d7d10be5d7850644554f628cc3dec346207d6ed80728f54fbfc2b8462f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da8b24ca2b23662612b505a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刘海？啊，当我在想事情的时候，\r\n偶尔会把它撩上去。\r\n于是就这样定型了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4db8529560b8bb6e186a497a7eed36bd172b06290922c0e977d3e4f6a2e17274",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69dec413025a156aa76546ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不着急、不着急～\r\n还是悠闲地照着自己的步调过吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8245efd69b245f992e0008a3cfc0f87b522443b1cf952699300d6147d2508fbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4aba7ea2ead37af761563d63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いきますかー",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4aa9a93153319d5f8151046bd4df1d9acb6aa8f3870fbed14e61632392e7d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14014bae18cd52060afe8210",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有没有谁能来代替我跑步啊——",
      "source_fingerprint": "34fd9537422ee6299a87b45ca140c170857c165794aa5e7467fb0a6130db5cbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fafb2d9e92a6fc4235511e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那我就稍微去努力个一下吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c2d6dddf63ef776179b32492323649d267732395649ac73825f3d7c81653d85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da751ecbfc9eaf780c0acd15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇——哦。\r\n原来是到了训练的时间啦——",
      "source_fingerprint": "09829770d3ae1f737c83d9467009e2112a44c8a16d0c4f2d52a8f46f9c6a986a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:450aa93b4152dac7e8238c30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔也来认真跑一下好了，\r\n用脚踏车……说笑的啦。\r\n我偶尔也是会好好表现的哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "84e7fdbbe8a32db1de6dabadd59ae5a32e5144f497ede201913271936341e9d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71433b4734df0629363b23d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，总之呢，想要跑出一场\r\n大家都觉得有趣的比赛呢，呀哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c40031bbd7c58d2ca7763b7b7872cddd7c265a2b13af15adbcde0d11fa50a782",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ab5f73b50858633561975c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就当作是搭到了宝船，\r\n全都交给我吧。\r\n掌舵就靠你咯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d27921edacf4d366b6b109baec95d7f7e33dadc4a303d1ef2c56ff8ea036be9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1020",
        "92007"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
